  "method": "Read UTF-8 source as text. Strip // and /* */ comments with string-aware lexical states while preserving line numbers. Mask quoted strings for compiler-directive and system-task detection. Inspect comment-stripped source for foreign-interface/dynamic-loading markers. No HDL parsing or execution.",
